{"schema_version":"1.0.0","metadata":{"trial_id":"202610081431-nether-temple-opus-effort-high","prompting_method_id":"concept-build-free.v0","model_id":"claude-opus-5-5","seed":11,"server_state_id":"concept-free.v1"},"style":{"name":"nether-temple / piglin gilded ziggurat","rationale":"Second pass fixes what read flat or open in round 0. (1) Hall walls were an open colonnade: they are now solid polished-blackstone walls x4-16 with real depth. Corners are 2x2 basalt piers projecting +1 on a gilded base, and gold pilasters project +1 at x8 and x12 to frame the portal. Red bays x5-7 and x13-15 are carved by NOT placing the front wall: the panel plane sits at z5, an upside-down stair arch heads each bay, and an arched niche (gilded sill, lantern, crimson trapdoor lintel) is recessed a further 1. A gilded base course runs along y4 and a chiseled frieze along y9. (2) The portal is 3 wide and 5 tall with a stepped stair arch and a gold lintel. Its door plane is recessed 2 (z6) and opens into a blackstone vestibule with a hanging lantern, so it reads as a dark lit mouth. The 5-wide grand stair bridges the lava and climbs the three plinth courses on axis x10. (3) The round-0 red roof read as a flat slab. The roof is now a hipped stair roof whose eave overhangs by 2, with a gold cornice ring beneath that the piers carry. The red window band is a vertical riser broken by dark mullions and capped by a slab ledge, so no red top surface shows. The courses step in 1 per course to y15. Peaked gold-raked gables rise over the front portal and the two side blind niches; the back is plain bays. Gilded eave tips carry chains and hanging lanterns. (4) The 7x7 pavilion has gold corner posts, red walls with gold-jambed dark centre openings, a chiseled band, and a stepped cap with gold corners. Above it the spire has a warped-wart/shroomlight lantern stage, a double gold cap and a blackstone-wall needle on axis. (5) The palette hierarchy is held: blackstone dominant, red only in recessed fields, gold only on edges and frames, soul fire against the lava moat with its slab lip. Eight basalt braziers with soul campfires stand on the plinth corners, the side middles and flanking the stair."},"palette":{"manifest":["minecraft:blackstone","minecraft:chain","minecraft:chiseled_polished_blackstone","minecraft:crimson_trapdoor","minecraft:gilded_blackstone","minecraft:gold_block","minecraft:lantern","minecraft:lava","minecraft:polished_basalt","minecraft:polished_blackstone","minecraft:polished_blackstone_brick_slab","minecraft:polished_blackstone_brick_stairs","minecraft:polished_blackstone_bricks","minecraft:polished_blackstone_wall","minecraft:red_nether_bricks","minecraft:shroomlight","minecraft:soul_campfire","minecraft:warped_wart_block"]},"placements":[{"op":"fill","from":[7,0,-2],"to":[13,0,-1],"block":"minecraft:polished_blackstone"},{"op":"fill","from":[0,0,0],"to":[20,0,0],"block":"minecraft:polished_blackstone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[0,0,1],"to":[0,0,20],"block":"minecraft:polished_blackstone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[1,0,1],"to":[7,0,1],"block":"minecraft:lava"},{"op":"fill","from":[8,0,1],"to":[12,0,18],"block":"minecraft:polished_blackstone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[13,0,1],"to":[19,0,1],"block":"minecraft:lava"},{"op":"fill","from":[20,0,1],"to":[20,0,20],"block":"minecraft:polished_blackstone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[1,0,2],"to":[1,0,19],"block":"minecraft:lava"},{"op":"fill","from":[2,0,2],"to":[7,1,18],"block":"minecraft:polished_blackstone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[13,0,2],"to":[18,1,18],"block":"minecraft:polished_blackstone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[19,0,2],"to":[19,0,19],"block":"minecraft:lava"},{"op":"fill","from":[2,0,19],"to":[18,0,19],"block":"minecraft:lava"},{"op":"fill","from":[1,0,20],"to":[19,0,20],"block":"minecraft:polished_blackstone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[0,1,0],"to":[20,1,0],"block":"minecraft:polished_blackstone_brick_slab","state":{"type":"bottom"}},{"op":"fill","from":[0,1,1],"to":[0,1,